  rw [bu,br,b3,b2,hk2,hk3]
  simpa only [Nat.one_mul] using (sub_fourth u d 1 (by decide)).symm
 rw [sub33CCCC_eq g cache cache1 cache2 cache3 h2R h2C h3R h3C s m (ps_cs g cl.c _ _ s h) ready]
