     L.core.modFlag,L.core.sumCarry].count (((eReg L).headD 0)):=List.count_pos_iff.mpr (by rw[hi];simp)
   omega
 · exact (eReg_away L hn _ ce).2.2 (List.mem_of_mem_drop hu)
